- Complete mediation — every input passes all controls before egress; load-bearing
  ordering is part of the contract.
- Least privilege — the project holds no long-lived secrets/keys it does not need;
  sensitive custody is delegated by contract.
- Defense in depth — independent controls each cover a distinct threat.
- Economy of mechanism — vetted standard crypto primitives only; no bespoke crypto. -->
